{"link":804,"text":252},{"linkPageModule":30,"newTab":30,"page":805,"type":34,"url":9},{"slug":251,"title":252},"Move from doing the work to running the business.","How Team Car Care Reached Over 70% Reconciliation Automation With Nominal"]